# The link warning as a toast in the session's window (LinkToast): it shows when the other Mac says the
# link can't keep up (faked: a loopback host never falls behind), a click on it uses the recommended
# quality, it goes by itself after 5 s, and the launcher's banner and the toolbar's warning stay while
# the link is still behind.
wait apps 30
click 75 242
wait stream 15
expect streamWindows.0.toast == false
linkwarning behind
expect streamWindows.0.toast == true
snap toast.png all
toast press
expect stream.bitrate == 4000000
wait notoast 2
linkwarning clear
expect streamWindows.0.toast == false
linkwarning behind
expect streamWindows.0.toast == true
wait notoast 8
expect streamWindows.0.toast == false
expect linkWarning.button == Use Low
expect streamWindows.0.toolbar contains sill.linkWarning
